o-point byte alignment for odd block counts; the symmetric checkpoint does not exercise explicit packed zero points.","hypothesis_2":"Reuse the existing narrow-direct GEMM path for eligible reconstructed tiles. The first probe hardcoded the hint; the final integration routes the existing disabled-by-default model experiment to MatMulNBits and exposes a strict benchmark flag. This is configuration of the same second hypothesis, not a third tuning experiment.","parity":"Every observation completed 2 timed cases and 4 validated passes; tokenizer, both heads, raw selected labels and thresholded selected labels passed. All recorded tag mismatch counts are zero. Per-head and probability error metrics are retained for every pass.","latency":"The narrow-direct observations are lower than the original local medians, but the final opt-in repeat is slower than the unconditional prototype. All samples are retained; no stable cross-hardware speedup or end-to-end qualification is claimed.","quality":"The selected pair includes a retained de-CH false edit, heisse to heiße. Executor parity preserves that error; no application guard or independent Dart correction loop was run.","provisional_complete_check_budget_seconds":0.5,"qualification":"Even the shortest measured forward median in these local arms exceeds the provisional complete-check budget. Full correction/guard-loop, realistic sentence-length and target-device qualification remain open."},"limitations":["Only 2 of 30 frozen cases were used locally; first-pass token counts are 7 and 10, with four total saved passes.","Timed work excludes tokenizer, hashes, reference-buffer reads, edit decoding, iterative correction, application guards and editor overhead.","Hash verification may warm filesystem caches before graph loading; cold_first_inference_seconds means first forward after setup, not a cold-disk measurement.","Three timing samples cannot establish a robust latency distribution; local host load varied across sequential runs.","This local machine differs from the hosted runner. Do not merge samples or compute speed ratios across local and hosted runs.","The final opt-in integration preserves narrowDirectGemm disabled by default. This observation explicitly uses --narrow-direct true.","Forward/reference-pass replay parity is not independently implemented complete Dart correction parity.","Numeric thresholds were retained unchanged across all four arms; this record does not relax a gate after observing results.","No Rust/FFI backend, CrispEmbed/ggml execution, Q4_K model or shipping application provider is qualified here.","Updated full hosted qualification remains pending review in this record; no run ID or result is inferred."]}
